WEBVTT

00:05:30.826 --> 00:05:32.453
But in politics,

00:05:32.495 --> 00:05:34.080
big ideas only get you so far.

00:05:34.121 --> 00:05:36.540
That's been a problem
for the Left historically,

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.833
I don't know if you know.

00:05:37.875 --> 00:05:40.753
And what matters
in the here and now, in 2022,

00:05:40.795 --> 00:05:42.588
are concrete proposals.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.674
So how do we leverage
the technology revolution?

00:05:45.716 --> 00:05:47.468
How do we employ the state

00:05:47.468 --> 00:05:49.970
to address all the challenges
I've just spoken about,

00:05:50.012 --> 00:05:53.516
which I'm pretty sure everybody
in this room would acknowledge?

00:05:53.557 --> 00:05:57.144
Rising inequality,
the climate crisis, demographic aging.

00:05:57.895 --> 00:06:01.065
For some, the answer
is a universal basic income,